// Harvesters (WP7.2, docs/rules/economy.md): a refinery, harvesters and an ore field on the
// 256 by 256 cell playfield (assets/maps/playfield256), a few full cycles each: search, drive,
// mine, drive back, ask the refinery by message, queue, unload, repeat.
//
// `unit_defs` names a FROZEN copy of the shipped definitions of WP7.2 (harvest_defs, a copy of
// assets/config/{unit_defs,unit_classes,weapon_defs}.ron). The harvest and ore rules are written
// out below, so editing the shipped harvest.ron or ore.ron never moves this checksum. Kinds are
// the permanent numbers of the records: 2 refinery, 11 harvester.
//
//   slot 0  the refinery of player 0 on (96, 86): 3 by 4 cells, exit cell (99, 88), so the dock
//           point is (99.5, 88.5)
//   slot 1  a harvester of player 0 on (104, 90), tick 0
//   slot 2  a harvester of player 0 on (106, 92), tick 0: it reaches the refinery a little
//           after slot 1 and queues behind it
//   slot 3  a harvester of player 1 on (104, 96), tick 0: its player has no refinery, so it
//           mines a load and then waits holding it (nothing is delivered for player 1)
//   slot 4  a harvester of player 0 on (94, 91), tick 600: three on one refinery
//
// The ore: the field of 28 cells around (118, 82), x 115 to 121, y 79 to 84, 120 each, with the
// regrowth of the shipped ore.ron (1 per 200 ticks per cell). A rock patch (x 100 to 106,
// y 79 to 86) lies between the refinery and the field: the route goes round it.
//
// tools/sf_headless/tests/harvest.rs asserts the cycle (stage by stage), that the delivered ore
// plus the loads carried equals what left the ore cells, the delivered total, the queue and the
// pinned checksum. CI runs the scenario on Linux and Windows and requires the checksum in
// harvest.expected.
Scenario(
    name: "harvest",
    seed: 0x0007_0072,
    map: (width: 256, height: 256),
    map_name: Some("playfield256"),
    unit_defs: Some("harvest_defs"),
    buildings: true,
    factions: [(0, Meridian), (1, Veyran)],
    ore: Some((start: 120, max: 160, regrow_amount: 1, regrow_period: 200)),
    harvest: Some((
        harvesters: [11],
        capacity: 200,
        mine_amount: 4,
        mine_period: 8,
        unload_amount: 10,
        unload_period: 4,
        search_radius: 40,
        retry_period: 100,
        call_range: 6,
        grant_timeout: 400,
    )),
    ticks: 4500,
    commands: [
        (tick: 0, command: PlaceStructure(kind: 2, owner: 0, cell: (96, 86))),
        (tick: 0, command: SpawnUnit(kind: 11, owner: 0, cell: (104, 90))),
        (tick: 0, command: SpawnUnit(kind: 11, owner: 0, cell: (106, 92))),
        (tick: 0, command: SpawnUnit(kind: 11, owner: 1, cell: (104, 96))),
        (tick: 600, command: SpawnUnit(kind: 11, owner: 0, cell: (94, 91))),
    ],
)
